def QuotientGroup__preimageMkEquivSubgroupProdSet : (s : Elem (Subgroup X)) -> (t : Elem (powerset (HasQuotient__Quotient X s))) -> Elem (Equiv (Set__Elem (Set__preimage QuotientGroup__mk t)) (Prod (Subtype (x1 => Membership__mem s x1)) (Set__Elem t))) :=
  s => t => Equiv__mk (a => Prod__mk (times (Inv__inv (Quotient__out (QuotientGroup__mk a))) a) (QuotientGroup__mk a)) (a1 => times (Quotient__out (Prod__snd a1)) (Prod__fst a1)) (QuotientGroup__preimageMkEquivSubgroupProdSet___proof_4 s t) (QuotientGroup__preimageMkEquivSubgroupProdSet___proof_10 s t).

(; //LEAN:QuotientAddGroup.preimageMkEquivAddSubgroupProdSet ;)
def QuotientAddGroup__preimageMkEquivAddSubgroupProdSet : (s : Elem (AddSubgroup X)) -> (t : Elem (powerset (HasQuotient__Quotient X s))) -> Elem (Equiv (Set__Elem (Set__preimage QuotientAddGroup__mk t)) (Prod (Subtype (x1 => Membership__mem s x1)) (Set__Elem t))) :=
  s => t => Equiv__mk (a => Prod__mk (plus (Neg__neg (Quotient__out (QuotientAddGroup__mk a))) a) (QuotientAddGroup__mk a)) (a1 => plus (Quotient__out (Prod__snd a1)) (Prod__fst a1)) (QuotientAddGroup__preimageMkEquivAddSubgroupProdSet___proof_4 s t) (QuotientAddGroup__preimageMkEquivAddSubgroupProdSet___proof_10 s t).

